oston last week! I'm so excited about my upcoming trip to Boston. Look at this! See you soon, buddy!\n[Image caption: a photo of a book with a boarding pass and a boarding pass]\n[S17T6] (dia_id: D17:6)\n\nDave: Cool! Let me know when you're free and we can catch up in Boston.\n[S17T7] (dia_id: D17:7)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, for sure! I'll let you know when I'm in Boston. See you soon!\n[S17T8] (dia_id: D17:8)\n\nDave: Looking forward to seeing you! Have a safe trip, see ya!\n[S17T9] (dia_id: D17:9)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Gotta stay safe on the trip. Can't wait to see you there! I will contact you when I arrive. Goodbye!\n[S17T10] (dia_id: D17:10)","text_sha256":"7af6a6a54105651e4aa51e2bb5eed36e326375d4079b1bc1c332aefac7792f89","timestamp":"2023-09-02T09:19:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":404,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":11554,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":11958},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"Where was Calvin located in the last week of October 2023?","question_id":"conv-50-q068","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_pos